<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>中暑 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%B8%AD%E6%9A%91/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 15:55:24 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%B8%AD%E6%9A%91/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>异治法：论中湿 论中暑 论中寒</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-29-yizhifa/</link><pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 16:48:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-29-yizhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“异治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;同一病症采用不同治法而皆能取效&lt;/strong&gt;的原理。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;病同而治异，治法虽殊，理归一致。关键在于把握病机根本，因势利导，殊途同归&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>专治法：论直中阴寒 论中暑</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-26-zhuanzhifa/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 10:16:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-26-zhuanzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“专治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;直中阴寒与中暑&lt;/strong&gt;两种急症的专攻直入治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;病势急迫，当专治一脏，单刀直入。不宜广征药味、分调各路，而以一二味大将之药直捣病巢，方可速挽危局&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>痉湿暍病脉证治法第二</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-02/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 13:55:24 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-02/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E9%87%91%E5%8C%AE/">金匮</category><description>&lt;p&gt;中医讲的痉病区分为刚痉和柔痉二种，类似西医讲的「脑脊髓神经炎」简言叫「脑膜炎」。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;「湿病」就是中湿，湿有时候在身体里面，有时候在关节上面。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;「[暍]^(yē)」就是中暑，热天的时候中暑，这一篇就是在讲这些病症。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>